0..76 Comment "// What an inductive-recursive block refuses. The block is one admission, so"
77..153 Comment "// one refused member refuses every member with it: accessibility is checked"
154..231 Comment "// across the block, so a family named to the left of an arrow where no stage"
232..308 Comment "// reaches, in another family\'s field, refuses the block whole (#517); and a"
309..386 Comment "// decode a code\'s field holds must stand below the code, so a field decoding"
387..465 Comment "// a code it was not built from, or a decoder arm decoding its own code again,"
466..545 Comment "// refuses the decoder by the stage order and its codes with it. A decode reads"
546..615 Comment "// a call only when the call returns a code. The block also refuses a"
616..690 Comment "// hierarchy of universes by level at its universe code. That code decodes"
691..731 Comment "// to the family itself, one level down."
732..796 Comment "// Shared with `../../model/universe/inductive-recursive.gandr`."
797..799 Comment "//"
800..870 Comment "// - see: #3574 — not implemented: a hierarchy of universes by level"
872..909 Comment "// The naturals and the two branches."
